 	tristate "SDXI unit tests" if !KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
 	depends on SDXI && KUNIT
 	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
+	select PACKING
 	help
 	  KUnit tests for parts of the SDXI driver. Does not require
 	  SDXI hardware.
